     ... ).using('cold-storage')
 
+.. versionchanged:: 4.2
+
+    Support for prefetching from sliced querysets was added. The slice is
+    applied to the related objects of each instance, using a ``ROW_NUMBER()``
+    window function, so it requires a database that supports window functions.
+
+    >>> Restaurant.objects.prefetch_related(
+    ...     Prefetch('pizzas', queryset=Pizza.objects.all()[:3], to_attr='top_pizzas'),
+    ... )
+
 .. note::
 
     The ordering of lookups matters.
